sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client / Stub Resolver
  participant R as Recursive Resolver
  participant Root as Root Nameserver (.)
  participant TLD as .com TLD Nameserver
  participant Auth as Authoritative NS (example.com)

  C->>R: Query A/AAAA for api.example.com
  R->>Root: Where is api.example.com?
  Root-->>R: Referral to .com TLD NS
  R->>TLD: Where is api.example.com?
  TLD-->>R: Referral to example.com Authoritative NS
  R->>Auth: Query A/AAAA for api.example.com
  Auth-->>R: 93.184.216.34 (TTL = 300s)
  R-->>C: 93.184.216.34 (cached until TTL expires)
